{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794074674291,"sessionID":"ses_e48de3ad0ffeE5McT5ooWqWS7z","part":{"partID":"prt_1b72e9d3d0019O6lovIOFAZXmY","sessionID":"ses_e48de3ad0ffeE5McT5ooWqWS7z","messageID":"msg_1b72dcf8f001GL1f6GuXvinImS","type":"tool","id":"call_e7799af42380418a918364fc","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - 044 named sub-tracks and host repositories\ndescription: Review strategy for the named sub-track and host-repository implementation in commits ac32d66fed..7714ff26b1.\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy\n\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\n\n- Target: `specs/system-speckit/spec-folder-tooling/002-named-subtracks-and-host-repos` (spec-folder), implementation commits `ac32d66fed..7714ff26b1`\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n- Operator focus: review the named sub-track tooling, the doctor `project_owned` entry and host `.skilled` build, and the host trigger-index docs for correctness, flat-track non-regression, path containment, symlink handling and spec/doc alignment. Never open any `.env` file or any Barter file.\n- Stop conditions: 5 iterations under `stopPolicy=max-iterations`; convergence is telemetry only.\n- Success criteria: every dimension receives one full pass plus the operator focus; P0/P1 findings carry typed claim-adjudication packets; flat-track non-regression is explicitly tested.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview of declared named sub-tracks in system-spec-kit track tooling plus the three host-repository fixes shipped in the same packet.\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Barter's priority numbering and sub-track map (Barter phase 004 owns them).\n- Writes through a linked specs root (packet 037 owns them).\n- Implementing fixes: this loop is observation-only.\n- Opening any `.env` file or any Barter file.\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Hard ceiling: 5 iterations (`maxIterations: 5`).\n- A terminal P0 does not stop the loop early; it is carried to synthesis and forces FAIL.\n- Pause sentinel only.\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [none yet] | - | - | - |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[Populated when an approach stops yielding new findings]\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n[Consolidated after each iteration]\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\nIteration 1: correctness of declared sub-track discovery, refresh and sweep (track-roots.mjs, refresh-track-roots.mjs, sweep-track-roots.mjs) plus flat-track non-regression.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/lib/track-roots.mjs`, `runtime/cli/spec/{refresh-track-roots.mjs,sweep-track-roots.mjs,create.sh,validate.sh,archive.sh,repair-derived.cjs}`, `runtime/lib/graph/graph-metadata-parser.ts`, `runtime/lib/validation/orchestrator.ts`, `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/symlink-engine.cjs`, `doctor/assets/symlink-manifest.json`, docs under `runtime/data/README.md`, `references/structure/folder-structure.md`, `README.md`, `.skilled/commands/speckit/search.md`, `runtime/data/trigger-index.json`.\n- Behavior claims: spec.md REQ-001..REQ-012 and SC-001/SC-002; a declared sub-track is a direct child of a track whose `description.json` has `level: \"sub-track\"` and holds a `graph-metadata.json` in the track-root shape; undeclared folders and symlinked sub-tracks get advisory diagnostics only; flat tracks must behave byte-identically.\n- Reuse and conventions: existing `readWorkingTreeTracks`/`readCommitTracks` shape, `validate_track_value` containment rules, reducer-owned anchors in strategy.\n- Review risks and gaps: no `resource-map.md`; compiled `dist` orchestrator is not in the diff; Barter files and `.env` files are out of scope by instruction.\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent file changed |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No playbook changed |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| [pending first iteration] | - | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 5\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-deepseek-2-1794073425298-2jo74b, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-07T18:01:38Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-speckit/spec-folder-tooling/002-named-subtracks-and-host-repos/review/lineages/deepseek-2/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-speckit/spec-folder-tooling/002-named-subtracks-and-host-repos/review/lineages/deepseek-2/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-speckit/spec-folder-tooling/002-named-subtracks-and-host-repos/review/lineages/deepseek-2/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"---\\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - 044 named sub-tracks and host repositories\\ndescription: Review strategy for the named sub-track and host-repository implementation in commits ac32d66fed..7714ff26b1.\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Review Strategy\\n\\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\\n\\n- Target: `specs/system-speckit/spec-folder-tooling/002-named-subtracks-and-host-repos` (spec-folder), implementation commits `ac32d66fed..7714ff26b1`\\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\\n- Operator focus: review the named sub-track tooling, the doctor `project_owned` entry and host `.skilled` build, and the host trigger-index docs for correctness, flat-track non-regression, path containment, symlink handling and spec/doc alignment. Never open any `.env` file or any Barter file.\\n- Stop conditions: 5 iterations under `stopPolicy=max-iterations`; convergence is telemetry only.\\n- Success criteria: every dimension receives one full pass plus the operator focus; P0/P1 findings carry typed claim-adjudication packets; flat-track non-regression is explicitly tested.\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview of declared named sub-tracks in system-spec-kit track tooling plus the three host-repository fixes shipped in the same packet.\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Barter's priority numbering and sub-track map (Barter phase 004 owns them).\\n- Writes through a linked specs root (packet 037 owns them).\\n- Implementing fixes: this loop is observation-only.\\n- Opening any `.env` file or any Barter file.\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Hard ceiling: 5 iterations (`maxIterations: 5`).\\n- A terminal P0 does not stop the loop early; it is carried to synthesis and forces FAIL.\\n- Pause sentinel only.\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| [none yet] | - | - | - |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n[First iteration -- populated